    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Ritual Specialist",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Iron Taviah has a +2 circumstance bonus to the primary checks to perform a ritual. In addition, she can reduce the number of secondary casters for a ritual by 1. When she does, she must fulfill any requirements for the secondary caster, and she attempts the secondary check normally performed by that secondary caster. She can't replace a secondary caster who is the target of the spell (as in the Atone ritual)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Scattered Coven",
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "When the characters meet Iron Taviah, the Graveclaw is at the height of its power. As a scattered coven, the Graveclaw grants Taviah the ability to cast the following spells as 3rd-rank occult spells, once per day each, without requiring help from her fellow coven members: Acid Arrow, Curse of Lost Time, Earthbind, Harm, Mimic Undead, Summon Construct, and Water Walk."
